The layer that makes this build a game rather than a scene. Every other micro is
a mechanism; this one tells the player what they are doing.

- **Briefing** — modal, shown before play. States the goal and lists every step.
- **Step panel** — what the current step teaches, on screen while playing.
- **Hint bar** — always names the next action. Never says "good luck".

