## How a step clears

This does not decide what "done" means. It finds the objectives tracker by duck
type (anything exposing `CompletedRequired` + `MissionComplete`) and reads its
completed count, so the tracker stays the single definition of completion. A
step that never clears means its objective has no event source — see SEAM 8 in
`src/unity_compose.py`.
